{"type":"message","id":"92ac21ab","parentId":"f969abee","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:02:22.044Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is returning error 1101 for all requests. The GET endpoints work fine. Let me check if there's something wrong with the request format or if the POST endpoint is actually disabled/broken.\n\nError code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker threw a exception\". This could mean the send endpoint is currently failing in the backend.\n\nLet me report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 2026-05-20 20:01 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成：**\n- `GET /history` → **正常**（双线程均可访问）\n- `POST /send` → **异常**（返回 error code 1101，Worker 端可能有问题）\n\n**线程状态：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 人类讨论 |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 无 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 无 |\n\n双线程均无新的人类讨论，无需回复。\n\n⚠️ **注意：** `POST /send` 端点当前返回 1101 错误（Cloudflare Worker 异常），建议检查 `send` 函数的部署状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7149,"output":248,"cacheRead":11024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18421,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779307335627,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e3200d9c-2fd1-4c7f-8d1d-d85496dcb25a"}}
